- Use `code` for imports in Api and CodeBlock files
- Only can import from CodeBlock 
- Don't use async/await in API and CodeBlock code
- Use `k.api.get/post/put/delete/patch` for API endpoints
- Get query parameters with `k.request.queryString`
- Get form data with `k.request.form.get(key)`
